# @hub-lanes

# ── FLY IDLE MACHINE STOP (BH-6061) ─────────────────────────────────────────
# Every 5 minutes from :02 (BH-5781 spread): list every app the org token sees,
# ask each app's idle signal (catalog/fly-idle-signals.json), and `flyctl
# machine stop` a started machine idle more than the settings row
# fly.idle_stop_after_s (900). Never destroys. Each stop writes a row to the jobs
# worker; Mission Control shows them on /machines. An app with no signal is
# never stopped and alerts after 1 h. Hub only: the hub holds FLY_API_TOKEN and
# sees every box's queue claims. Single run per box (locks/fly-idle-reaper.lock).
# Off via the lane's flags/lane-off-<id> flag (bin/harness-ctl.sh off <id>).
2-59/5 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/fly-idle-reaper.sh >> /root/harness/logs/fly-idle-reaper.log 2>&1
